# The private test suite. This block must mirror the testing block in
# .gitignore: anything kept out of the repo is by definition absent from CI
# and present only in a developer working copy, so a build there picks it up
# and typechecks it against devDependencies the image does not install.
# Half-mirroring it is what broke the build on 2026-08-18 and again today.
**/*.test.ts
lib/__itest__
vitest.config.ts
vitest.integration.config.ts
/coverage
